{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
This function brings the specified window to front and sets input focus. The window should already be visible and not iconified.\par
By default, both windowed and full screen mode windows are focused when initially created. Set the GLFW_FOCUSED to disable this behavior.\par
Also by default, windowed mode windows are focused when shown with {\b glfwShowWindow}. Set the GLFW_FOCUS_ON_SHOW to disable this behavior.\par
{\b Do not use this function}  to steal focus from other applications unless you are certain that is what the user wants. Focus stealing can be extremely disruptive.\par
For a less disruptive way of getting the user's attention, see attention requests.\par
