{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
This function retrieves the size, in screen coordinates, of each edge of the frame of the specified window. This size includes the title bar, if the window has one. The size of the frame may vary depending on the window-related hints used to create it.\par
Because this function retrieves the size of each window frame edge and not the offset along a particular coordinate axis, the retrieved values will always be zero or positive.\par
Any or all of the size arguments may be {\f2 NULL} . If an error occurs, all non-{\f2 NULL}  size arguments will be set to zero.\par
