{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Sets the aspect ratio of the specified window. }}\par
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
This function sets the required aspect ratio of the content area of the specified window. If the window is full screen, the aspect ratio only takes effect once it is made windowed. If the window is not resizable, this function does nothing.\par
The aspect ratio is specified as a numerator and a denominator and both values must be greater than zero. For example, the common 16:9 aspect ratio is specified as 16 and 9, respectively.\par
If the numerator and denominator is set to {\f2 GLFW_DONT_CARE}  then the aspect ratio limit is disabled.\par
The aspect ratio is applied immediately to a windowed mode window and may cause it to be resized.\par
