{
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Sets the opacity of the whole window. }}\par
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
This function sets the opacity of the window, including any decorations.\par
The opacity (or alpha) value is a positive finite number between zero and one, where zero is fully transparent and one is fully opaque.\par
The initial opacity value for newly created windows is one.\par
A window created with framebuffer transparency may not use whole window transparency. The results of doing this are undefined.\par
